hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"220","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Khalifa, aur Amr bin Ali, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Yazeed bin Zuray', kaha: Haddasana Hajjaj Sawwaf, Hanan se, Abi Usman Nahdi se, kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko rehan (khushbu dar patta) diya jaye to woh usey na radd kare, kyunke woh jannat se nikla hai."
"221","[AI-translation] Haddasana Umar bin Ismail bin Mujalid bin Saeed al-Hamdani, mujhe mere abu ne hadees bayaan ki, Bayan se, Qais bin Abi Hazim se, Jarir bin Abdullah se, kaha: Umar bin Khattab ke samne pesh kiya gaya. Jarir ne apni chadar utar di aur izaar mein chalne lage, to unko kaha: Apni chadar utha lo. Unhon ne logo se kaha: Maine Jarir se zyada khoobsoorat shakhs nahi dekha, magar jo hum tak Yusuf (alayhis salam) ki soorat ki khabar pohnchi hai."
"222","[AI-translation] Haddasana Humayd bin Mas'ada al-Basri, kaha: Haddasana Humayd bin al-Aswad, Usama bin Zaid se, Zuhri se, Urwa se, Ayesha se, kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) aisi tezi se baat nahi farmate thay jaisi tum sartaare ho, balke raoshan aur faasil dar lafz mein takallum farmate thay, jo unke paas baith jata usey yaad rahta."
"223","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, kaha: Haddasana Abu Qutaiba Salam bin Qutaiba, Abdullah bin Muthanna se, Thumama se, Anas bin Malik se, kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) kalma teen baar dohrate thay taa-ke unse baat samajh li jaye."
"224","[AI-translation] Haddasana Sufyan bin Waki', kaha: Haddasana Jamia bin Amr bin Abdur Rahman al-Ijli, kaha: Mujhe Bani Tamim ke ek shakhs ne, jo Abi Halah ke aulaad mein se the aur jin ki kuniyat Abu Abdullah thi (aur Abi Halah Khadija ke shohar the), hadees bayaan ki, ek ibn Abi Halah se, Hasan bin Ali se, kaha: Maine apne khala Hind bin Abi Halah se (jo wasiyat karne wale thay) poocha, maine kaha: Mujhe Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke kalam ki sift batao. Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) gham mein dole rehne wale, hamesha soch mein rehne wale, unhe koi aaram na tha, lambe khamoshi wale, bina zaroorat koi baat nahi farmate, kalam ki shuruwat karte aur usay Allah Ta'ala ke naam se khatam karte, jami' kalmaat mein takallum farmate, unka kalam faasil tha, na fazool tha aur na qasar, na sakht the aur na haqeer, nemat ki taazeem karte chahay woh kitni hi chhoti kyun na ho, usme se kisi cheez ki mazamat na karte, magar mazay wale ki na mazamat karte na tareef, duniya aur duniya ki cheezein unhe ghussa na dilateen, lekin jab haq par tajawuz kiya jata to unke gusse ke aage kuch na thehar sakta jab tak woh haq ke liye nasr (madad) na kar lete, apni zaat ke liye ghussa nahi karte aur na apni zaat ka intiqam lete, ishara me poora hath hilate, ta'ajjub me hath palat dete, guftagu me hathon ko aapas me milate, apni dayein hath ki taluu se baayen angoothay ke pet ko thapthapate, ghussa me mun pher lete aur tarafdaari karte, khushi me nazar jhuka lete, unke hasi ka zyada tar hissa muskurahat thi, jo barf ke daane ki tarah hoti."
"225","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmed bin Munee', qala: haddasana Abbad bin Al-Awwam, qala: akhbarana Al-Hajjaj wa huwa Ibni Artah, 'an Simak bin Harb, 'an Jabir bin Samurah, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki pindaliyon mein dubla pan tha, aur aap hansate nahi thay magar muskurate the, toh jab mein Unhe dekhta toh kehta: ankhon mein surme wala hai, halanke woh surme wala nahi hain."
"226","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaybah bin Sa'eed, qala: akhbarana Ibnu Lahi'ah, 'an Ubaidullah bin Al-Mughirah, 'an Abdullah bin Al-Harith bin Jaz', annahu qala: mein ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se zyada muskurane wala kisi ko nahi dekha."
"227","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmed bin Khalid Al-Khallal, qala: haddasana Yahya bin Ishaq As-Sailahani, qala: haddasana Laith bin Sa'd, 'an Yazid bin Abi Habib, 'an Abdullah bin Al-Harith, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ka hansna muskurane ke siwa kuch nahi tha."
"228","[AI-translation] Hamein hadees bayaan ki Abu Ammar Al-Husayn bin Hurayth ne, kaha: Hamein hadees bayaan ki Waki' ne, kaha: Hamein hadees bayaan ki Al-A'mash ne, Ma'rur bin Suwayd se, woh Abu Dharr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main janta hoon jannat mein dakhil hone wala pehla aadmi aur jahannam se nikalne wala aakhri aadmi. Qayamat ke din ek aadmi ko laya jayega, to kaha jayega: Is ke samne is ke chotay gunah pesh karo aur is ke baray gunah chhupaye jayenge. Phir us se kaha jayega: Tu ne falan falan din yeh yeh kiya tha, aur woh iqrar karega, inkar nahi karega, aur woh apne baray gunahon se darta hoga. Phir kaha jayega: Us ko us ki ki hui har burai ke badle ek nekhi do. To woh kahega: Mere gunah hain jo main yahan nahi dekh raha.."
